        "sid": "NUM 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmooko wák oo múk Kana'ani oo Aradi oo amór Negebúr hoót, gana axaás adór múk Israeli ir hi'iít ar loohír Atarimu, giri i haraatláy, muu bahh'ale guri hayóh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee múk Israeli al'axweesani gana oó' dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tawa kaahi, «Barnaxes mukwí ngu hanís gawaá dabaarén i ale, daqaní atén gixsaduuká' aqo in hhaamisaán.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ firor'ín gari axaás, múk Kana'ani nguri baaliyé'. Múk Israeli múk Kana'ani guri hhaamiís dinkwa nee gixsaduuine. Gawaá adoorihe didaadá' kari bay Horma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Horma:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gídaabárós a hhaamisa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli tari dír tloomár Horír wa tláy, loohír tlawtá Shamu kari óh as yaamaá Edomu kiwa harweeri. Ala baraá loohiro muu iri diqaay tsatmiít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy qununu/aay ngway iimu/uné' daanduú Mungú nee Mosewo, tawa kaahi, «Ahaá waáy gár tisa duxé' baraá yaamaá Misrír wa ale, nee gár tas qatlaan baraá xaanxaywí ale? Baraakae muruú /ayma i kaahh, tam ma'aay i kahhiyá', nee atén muruú /aymaarí tlií/ taa xinaaór ar faák.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ dayshér qarkú koom gari huúw baraá tla/ángw múkwí ale, múk yaariír oo Israeli kuri kikiíhh nee tari qaátl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy, muu iri tláy amór Mose, nguri bayé', «Tlakweema iga tleehhaán qoomár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nee kuunge nuwa i qununu/aán. AAKOÓ MUNGÚ firiimang daysheerí ngi hingeesi.» Gawaá adoorihe Mose muu guri aleefirín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose guri bay, «Dayshamoó muqslír sirdaa/aat tleehheek, ku qás gawaá ságw xa'anoó tlerantleér. Umuúqo heé taa kiíhh nee dayshamo, nee dayshamoduú muqslír sirdaa/aat nguri i qaytsiít, in hhooáy.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Mose dayshamoó muqslír sirdaa/aat guri tleéhh, guri qaás gawaá xa'anoó tlerantleér. Umuú heé taa qo kihhi nee dayshamo, nee dayshamoduú muqslír sirdaa/aat guri i qaytsiít, in hhooáy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xoorór Israeli tana kumiít aaiwo, nee xafay'ín nguri tleehhiyé' dír ta bay Oboti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari Obotír wa tláy ay Iye-abarimu, baraá xaanxoó bihhaá da/aáw oo digimuú Moabu, xafay'ín nguri didií tleehhiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tana didá' wa tláy xafay'ín kuri tleéhh baraá xatstá Seredi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tana male didá' wa tláy, xafay'ín kuri tleéhh bihhaá /iya awa yaaér Arnoni, tidá' baraá yaamaá Amorír daahh, iri waaraáhh baraá xaanxaay. Yaaér Arnoni an digimuú múk Moabu nee múk Amori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaangwí an gár axweesantí kasa gooín baraá kitaábuú slaqwarár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, tí kah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imiír amoodá' wa tleemu múk Israeli iri kumiít aaiwo ay Be'eri, dír hhalangwdá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose nguwa báy, «Muu dinkwaárí burumbureek, aníng i ma'aay haniís.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diirihe múk Israeli daa'aangw guri óh,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tana baraá xaanxáy wa tláy dír ta bay Matana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tari Matanár wa tláy ay Nahalieli, tari Nahalieli wa tláy ay Bamoti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tari Bamoti wa tláy ay xatstá dah baraá yaamaá Moabu, dír tsitsinír tloomár Pisga, tidá' baraá xaanxoó ga/áw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xoorór Israeli afoorí kana ya/aáw dír waawutmo Sihoni oo Amori tawa kaahi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Na'amaamís, ti pa/ángw waarahhmaáwí sleer baraá yaamuuwoge, atén a bihhií paslaanaaká tawa dahaan baraá qamu, laqaá qamaá sabiíbu, laqaá ma'aá baraá hhaleeri i wahanaaká. Atén a waaraahhaán ar loohír ur ar waawutmo ay dír tay ti'iitaan baraá yaamuuwoge.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Sihoni múk Israeli iwa waaraahhi ar baraá yaamuuwós gwaa ya/aniiká. Mukós guna burumbuúr, iri tláy ay Yahasa, tidár baraá xaanxaay, as xoorór Israeli ngiwa i haraatlay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala múk Israeli inós nguri gaasiyé' ar paángár xaraasl, yaamuuwós ngiri hayoohiyé', iimír yaaér Arnonír wa tleemu ay yaaér Yaboki, ay yaamaá múk Amoni. Qoomaadae digimuú yaamaá Amoni ku ló'wa xún. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xoorór Israeli gixsaduuká' sleémeero ngiri hayoohiyé', inooín tari baraá gixsadaá múk Amorír wa hoót, gixsár Heshboni nee ayeemaá isaapaydá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heshboni qoomaadae a gixsár waawutmo Sihoni oo xoorór Amori, kudá' aáng geeraawo taa slaaqw nee waawutmoó xoorór Moabu, yaamuuwós sleémeero giri hayóh ay digimuú yaaér Arnoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaarí an gár /ayluuserhúng isa adoorír dá',",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy xoorór Israeli iri hót baraá yaamaá múk Amori wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
