        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Mose muu guri ya/aáw as gixsár Yaseri ngiwa tsawtsawusár aya', ngiri hayohiyé' dinkwa nee ayeemaá isaapaydá', múk Amori oo baraadá' hoót kuri guús.",
